OL,3,CThe runners, riders, and swimmers of
OL,4,Cthe 2026 SuperTri Finals
OL,6,FThousands are expected to gather for
OL,7,Fthe finale of a world-class racing
OL,8,Fcompetition in Jersey.
OL,10,FThe event is a global series of
OL,11,Ftriathlon festivals across Europe and
OL,12,FNorth America, culminating in the Pro
OL,13,FSeries Final.
OL,15,FUsually, athletes score points from
OL,16,Fthe race that go towards an overall
OL,17,Fleaderboard, but for the first time,
OL,18,FJersey will host a winner-takes-all
OL,19,Ffinal for both the men and women.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/12
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
