OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F351A1788542400
OL,3,CThe runners, riders, and swimmers of
OL,4,Cthe 2026 SuperTri Finals
OL,6,FMichael D'hulst, CEO and Co-Founder of
OL,7,FSupertri, says the island is the
OL,8,Fevent's "spiritual home".
OL,10,F"This is a huge year for Supertri as
OL,11,Fwe truly unify professional and
OL,12,Famateur racing," he explained.
OL,14,F"Our new Pro Series is at the pinnacle
OL,15,Fof short-course racing, and we cannot
OL,16,Fthink of a better stage for the Final
OL,17,Fthan Jersey. The stakes have never
OL,18,Fbeen higher, and the field reflects
OL,19,Fthat."
OL,21,FWhat is SuperTri?
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/12
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
