OL,3,CThe runners, riders, and swimmers of
OL,4,Cthe 2026 SuperTri Finals
OL,6,FSuperTri welcomes all athletes from
OL,7,Ffirst-timers to experienced racers,
OL,8,Fcompeting in locations across the
OL,9,Fglobe from Toulouse and Blenheim
OL,10,FPalace to Chicago and Austin, Texas.
OL,12,FThe Pro Series is where top athletes
OL,13,Ffrom around the world compete for a
OL,14,Fshare of an $800,000 prize purse.
OL,16,FIn Jersey, whoever wins both the
OL,17,Fwomen's and men's races will receive
OL,18,F$100,000.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/12
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
