OL,3,CThe runners, riders, and swimmers of
OL,4,Cthe 2026 SuperTri Finals
OL,6,FAthletes must swim, ride, and run
OL,7,Fthree laps of a track without a break,
OL,8,Finvolving:
OL,10,FAthletes can also win a shortcut
OL,11,Fcalled 'Short Chutes', which must only
OL,12,Fbe taken on lap one of the third and
OL,13,Ffinal run.
OL,15,FAny athlete who falls 90 seconds or
OL,16,Fmore behind the leader's pace at the
OL,17,Fend of an individual lap is eliminated.
OL,19,FWhen is it all happening?
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/12
