OL,3,CThe runners, riders, and swimmers of
OL,4,Cthe 2026 SuperTri Finals
OL,6,FThe build-up begins on Saturday 5
OL,7,FSeptember, with live entertainment and
OL,8,Factivities starting at Marina Gardens
OL,9,Fat Castle Quay from 3pm.
OL,11,FAthletes will then be introduced
OL,12,Fbetween 4pm and 5pm.
OL,14,FBoth the Men's and Women's Pro Series
OL,15,FFinal races will take place on Sunday
OL,16,F6 September, with the Fan Zone opening
OL,17,Ffrom 12:30pm.
OL,19,FWho is taking part?
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/12
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
