OL,3,CThe runners, riders, and swimmers of
OL,4,Cthe 2026 SuperTri Finals
OL,6,FAthletes can only qualify for the Pro
OL,7,FSeries Final if they finish 'Top
OL,8,FThree' at the Austin, Blenheim, or
OL,9,FToronto SuperTri events - or are on
OL,10,Fthe SuperTri central athlete roster.
OL,12,FThe frontrunners in the men's contest
OL,13,Finclude Paris 2024 British Olympic
OL,14,Fchampion Alex Yee, his Olympic
OL,15,Fmedallist Kiwi rival Hayden Wilde, and
OL,16,Fworld champion Matthew Hauser from
OL,17,FAustralia.
OL,19,FThe winner of the Jersey race,
OL,20,FHungarian Csonger Lehmann, returns
OL,21,Fwith the hope of retaining his crown.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/12
