OL,3,CThe runners, riders, and swimmers of
OL,4,Cthe 2026 SuperTri Finals
OL,6,FWilde won the overall SuperTri title
OL,7,Fin 2025, as Hauser and Yee share the
OL,8,Fstart line for the first time in more
OL,9,Fthan a year.
OL,11,FIn the women's race, it's another
OL,12,FParis 2024 Olympic champion in the
OL,13,Fform of France's Cassandre Beaugrand.
OL,15,FShe'll be competing against the
OL,16,Freigning SuperTri champion, Jeanne
OL,17,FLehair, as well as British Olympic
OL,18,Fmedallist Georgia Taylor-Brown and
OL,19,Fformer European champion Jolien
OL,20,FVermeylen.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G7/12
