OL,3,CThe runners, riders, and swimmers of
OL,4,Cthe 2026 SuperTri Finals
OL,6,FHome talent will also take to the
OL,7,Ftrack, including Siena Stephens, who
OL,8,Fremembers when SuperTri first came to
OL,9,Fthe island in 2017.
OL,11,FShe told ITV News: "I've been doing
OL,12,Ftriathlon for over 10 years now; it's
OL,13,Fbeen such a big part of my life.
OL,15,F"Having SuperTri on the island when it
OL,16,Ffirst started coming over was amazing
OL,17,Fto me; it was almost like watching the
OL,18,FOlympics or something like that."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G8/12
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
