OL,3,CThe runners, riders, and swimmers of
OL,4,Cthe 2026 SuperTri Finals
OL,6,FOne notable omission from the
OL,7,Fcompetition will be Jonny Brownlee,
OL,8,Fwho has announced his retirement from
OL,9,FSuperTri from Jersey today (Friday 4
OL,10,FSeptember).
OL,12,FIt was hoped that the decorated
OL,13,FBritish Olympian would compete this
OL,14,Fyear, but has chosen to not push
OL,15,Fthrough an ongoing injury.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G9/12
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
