PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F351A1788542400
OL,3,CThe runners, riders, and swimmers of
OL,4,Cthe 2026 SuperTri Finals
OL,6,FOn the SuperTri website, Brownlee
OL,7,Fwrote: "I'm not sure you are ever
OL,8,Ftruly ready to retire from
OL,9,Fprofessional racing, but after an
OL,10,Fincredible journey, that's where I
OL,11,Ffind myself today.
OL,13,F"My body is telling me I cannot have
OL,14,Fthe fairytale ending, but it's been
OL,15,Fpretty close to a dream career, one I
OL,16,Fnever thought was possible when I woke
OL,17,Fup in the middle of the night to watch
OL,18,Fthe Sydney Olympics aged 10.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws        G10/12
