OL,3,CThe runners, riders, and swimmers of
OL,4,Cthe 2026 SuperTri Finals
OL,6,F"I'm proud of the impact we had on the
OL,7,Fsport around the world, and especially
OL,8,Fthe growth of triathlon in the UK
OL,9,F(...) Hopefully I'll see you out there
OL,10,Fsoon, with a smile on your face, doing
OL,11,Fwhat we all love."
OL,13,FHow can I watch?
OL,15,FSuperTri is free to spectate in person
OL,16,Fin Jersey across the Waterfront.
OL,18,FThe event will also be livestreamed to
OL,19,FSuperTri's YouTube Channel and in the
OL,20,FFan Zone at Marina Gardens.
